<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Joanna, Duchess of Brabant</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">1322–1406</span></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Joanna was Duchess of Brabant and Limburg from 1355 until her death in 1406. With her husband Wenceslaus of Luxembourg she swore the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/joyous-entry-of-1356">Joyous Entry</a> charter in 1356 to secure recognition by the estates of Brabant. Childless, she arranged the succession of the Burgundian house, and the duchy passed to her great-nephew Antoine of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/burgundy">Burgundy</a>.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/joanna-duchess-of-brabant.jpg" alt="Joanna, Duchess of Brabant" width="255" height="250" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: AnonymousUnknown author · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:JohannavanBrabant.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
